<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
>

<title>LeadDesk | Submission Successful</title>

<style>

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f8fc;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #111827;
    }

    .success-card {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 520px;
        background: white;
        padding: 50px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid #eef0f5;
    }

    .success-icon {
        width: 75px;
        height: 75px;
        margin: 0 auto 25px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #ecfdf5;
        color: #10b981;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 38px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .message {
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .back-button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 13px 24px;
        background: #6366f1;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .back-button:hover {
        background: #4f46e5;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .brand {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #9ca3af;
    }

    .brand span {
        color: #6366f1;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

</style>


</head>

<body>


<div class="success-card">

    <div class="success-icon">
        ✓
    </div>

    <h1>
        Thanks for reaching out!
    </h1>

    <p class="message">
        Your inquiry has been submitted successfully.
        Our team will review your project details and get back
        to you soon.
    </p>

    <a
        href="/"
        class="back-button"
    >
        ← Back to Home
    </a>

    <p class="brand">
        Powered by <span>LeadDesk</span>
    </p>

</div>

</body>

</html>
